{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117194443553-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117201630\"/><p>兩輛被困之的士。</p><p>今晚(17日)約7時，葵涌葵福路近葵盛游泳池，有地底食水管爆裂湧出大量水，並造成路面下陷。兩輛駛經之市區的士，車輪駛入凹陷的路中被困，當中一輛「小露寶」更是尾轆凌空。</p><p>根據現場圖片及影片可見，爆水管位置滿布碎石，泥水不斷噴出，且沿斜路流向低處。警員接報到場，封閉涉事路段避免再有其他車輛駛過，水務署也派員趕至閂水掣及展開搶修。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.317609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:44:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:23.936282+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:14.998989+00:00","content_hash":"22adb269e5333d734514d48c0c0f407ee06499af68ca35cd60d2a9e13070ef5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.317609+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}